mentation status remains Open. Source obligation `language/errors/emit-ai-policy-failure`: Emit structured audit/policy evidence for AI/model/tool/schema/defense/review failure instead of losing it in exception text. Accept: Emit structured policy/audit artifacts for model-provider failure, tool failure, schema validation, policy denial, prompt-defense trigger and human-review denial, preserving source spans and generated-origin chains. Actual external account/billing errors may remain explicit; removed project quotas are not restored. Reject: Reject free-text-only or missing AI/tool failure evidence, omitted policy/schema/review identity and lost source/generated origins; report L9-AI-ERROR. Required outputs: Typed AI/tool failure record, policy/audit/replay links, validation/denial fixtures and source-bound diagnostics. Dependencies consume versioned facts/receipts from auth/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/enforce-grant-intersection-attenuation-revocation-phase-and-lifetime, effects/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/effects3-check-legality-and-ordering; they do not require blanket component completion. Implementation status remains Open. Source obligation `language/errors/emit-durable-workflow-failure`: Emit and replay a durable workflow failure record with its step/input/error identity, retry/compensation policy and external-result/replay provenance. Accept: Persist and replay a workflow failure with step ID, input and output/error schemas, retry/compensation policy, time, external-call results and replay ID; retain source/generated origins and exercise failure plus compensation replay. Reject: Reject workflow failure without durable record, missing required schema/policy/result/replay identity or live re-execution during recorded replay; report L9-WORKFLOW-ERROR. Required outputs: Durable typed failure and compensation records, replay equality/refusal fixtures and source/generated-origin diagnostic artifacts. Dependencies consume versioned facts/receipts from effects/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/effects3-check-legality-and-ordering, auth/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/enforce-grant-intersection-attenuation-revocation-phase-and-lifetime; they do not require blanket component completion. Implementation status remains Open."}
